  "description": "Although he was born as the second child of the current king, it is natural to become a crown prince because he is the enemy of the resuscitation of the palace, so Prince Jeseong Wan thought he would become king someday. A girl who lost her mother early and grew up as a baby match, but grew up as the king of Yakam Village while learning knowledge of herbs over her father's shoulder, a herbalist. The boy and girl, who had no connection, formed an unwelcome relationship from the new month's great full moon. No one knew then. There is a dark shadow in Wan, who firmly believes that he will be king. Also, I thought I would meet a child who I had never doubted because it was a bad relationship... \n\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/48217194)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58081957), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B1%B0%EC%A7%80%EC%99%95%EC%9E%90/2739)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/113842)",
